# Polish: the rules the formant voice speaks it by (docs/tts.md,
# "Other languages"). Written from Polish spelling, close to one letter, one sound: the digraphs, the softening i, the nasal vowels, final devoicing. Stress: the second-last syllable.
name Polish
stress penult
unstressed 2
vowels aąeęioóuy
weak i w z na do o a że się nie to od po za ze we

